  "😀 Emoji 速查表": "😀 Emoji Cheat Sheet",
  "常用 Emoji 与其 Unicode 码点速查。": "A quick reference for common emoji and their Unicode code points.",
  "表示": "Representation",
  "：每个 emoji 对应一个或多个 Unicode 码点，如 😀 为 U+1F600。": ": each emoji maps to one or more Unicode code points, for example 😀 is U+1F600.",
  "肤色": "Skin tone",
  "：U+1F3FB–U+1F3FF 为肤色修饰符，附加在人物 emoji 之后改变肤色。": ": U+1F3FB–U+1F3FF are skin-tone modifiers appended after a person emoji to change its tone.",
  "：零宽连接符 U+200D 把多个 emoji 组合成一个（如家庭 👨‍👩‍👧）。": ": the zero-width joiner U+200D combines several emoji into one (a family, for instance 👨‍👩‍👧).",
  "变体": "Variants",
  "：U+FE0F 强制彩色显示，U+FE0E 强制文本样式；显示效果依赖系统字体。": ": U+FE0F forces colour presentation and U+FE0E forces the text style; how it actually renders depends on the system font.",
  "最近使用": "Recently used",
  "点击下方 emoji 复制，最近使用的会显示在这里": "Click an emoji below to copy it; the most recent ones appear here.",
  "💡 使用提示": "💡 Tips",
  "点击 emoji 即可复制到剪贴板": "Click an emoji to copy it to the clipboard.",
  "支持中英文关键词搜索（如 \"笑\"、\"love\"、\"动物\"）": "Keyword search in English or Chinese (for example \"laugh\", \"love\", \"animal\").",
  "分类浏览：表情、手势、动物、食物、活动、旅行、物品、符号": "Browse by category: faces, gestures, animals, food, activity, travel, objects and symbols.",
  "最近使用的 emoji 会显示在顶部，方便快速复用": "Recently used emoji appear at the top for quick reuse.",
  "历史记录保存在浏览器本地，刷新页面不丢失": "History is stored locally in the browser and survives a page refresh.",
  "📚 深度解析：Emoji 速查表": "📚 Deep Dive: Emoji Cheat Sheet",
  "按分类找 Emoji 与码点。": "Find emoji and code points by category.",
  "写文案或提交信息时快速找到合适的 emoji 并复制码点，避免从聊天记录里翻找。": "Find the right emoji and copy its code point while writing copy or a commit message, instead of digging through old chats.",
  "查": "Look up",
  "笑脸类 😀😃😄，附": "Smiley faces 😀😃😄, with the",
  "如何按名称搜？": "How do I search by name?",
  "本表支持分类/关键词检索。": "This reference supports browsing by category and searching by keyword.",
  "为什么复制的 emoji 在别处显示成方框？": "Why does a copied emoji show as a box elsewhere?",
  "说明对方系统的字体没有该字符的字形，通常是 emoji 版本较新（Unicode 每年新增）而系统未更新。解决办法是换用引入较早、覆盖面广的 emoji，或确保关键含义不依赖 emoji 传达（同时保留文字说明）。": "It means the other system has no glyph for that character — usually the emoji is newer (Unicode adds more every year) and the system has not been updated. The fix is to fall back on emoji that were introduced earlier and are widely supported, or to make sure the key meaning does not ride on the emoji alone (keep the wording alongside it).",
  "✅ 已复制": "✅ Copied",
